                        "form": "graingue"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2697dd9-9b2b-345d-9d87-a56e47081354",
                        "entry_id": "e73ba547-53c0-3d3d-9d09-ed6eb59738ed",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Séduction."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f7298ff-8d2f-48ff-9943-b6f8aa390fbe",
                                "sense_id": "f2697dd9-9b2b-345d-9d87-a56e47081354",
                                "text": "… étape suivante : s'inviter dans son bureau pour, officiellement, le rapport de mission et officieusement lui faire le plus beau de tous les gringues."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74f617f2-c47a-4152-9df0-6648508ef016",
                                "sense_id": "f2697dd9-9b2b-345d-9d87-a56e47081354",
                                "text": "Et puis il y a les femmes. La femme du consul du Brésil m’a fait du gringue pendant huit jours."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "caab8f7d-6e5b-4d24-9052-3078a51de8bc",
                                "sense_id": "f2697dd9-9b2b-345d-9d87-a56e47081354",
                                "text": "Le type temporise. Il a envie de continuer le trajet et d’en avoir pour son argent. Mais la fille lui fait un tel gringue qu’il la suit dans les entrailles de l’embarcation, là, allumeuse, elle le rembarre et l’assomme avec un cendrier."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "199011cf-83f2-4630-9756-e0ca9afefe90",
                        "source_entry_id": "e73ba547-53c0-3d3d-9d09-ed6eb59738ed",
                        "source_sense_id": "f2697dd9-9b2b-345d-9d87-a56e47081354",
                        "target_lang_word": "Anmache",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Anmache",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6031d27e-ee7d-3e6b-8275-e1d47a9269b1",
                                        "entry_id": "41a44cf3-7f74-3580-bb3f-8399d2c9ec6d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "offensives Ansprechen einer Person, in dem unverhohlen ein sexuelles Interesse an ihr kundgetan wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5b99527-840b-4a57-965b-9cb15f484dcd",
                                                "sense_id": "6031d27e-ee7d-3e6b-8275-e1d47a9269b1",
                                                "text": "Auf die fantasielose Anmache ihres Sitznachbarn reagierte Christiane nicht."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "583dcf3a-e40c-4675-8d34-3885c317c208",
                                                "sense_id": "6031d27e-ee7d-3e6b-8275-e1d47a9269b1",
                                                "text": "Der Chef versucht es bei den neuen Kolleginnen immer wieder mit derselben blöden Anmache."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6391597-902a-4989-8b05-e989c7abf365",
                                                "sense_id": "6031d27e-ee7d-3e6b-8275-e1d47a9269b1",
                                                "text": "„Man sollte die tägliche Frage nach dem Verheiratetsein immer bejahen und die Anmachen der Männer nicht erwidern.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1af1c0f-be29-4fd2-9038-caf739e9709e",
                                                "sense_id": "6031d27e-ee7d-3e6b-8275-e1d47a9269b1",
                                                "text": "„Von plumpen Anmachen, wie sie die anderen Mädels ertragen mussten und meist auch kommentarlos hinnahmen, wurde sie an ihrem ersten Arbeitstag glücklicherweise weitestgehend verschont.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4ba0026-f313-4d71-9c58-3077faa43169",
                                                "sense_id": "6031d27e-ee7d-3e6b-8275-e1d47a9269b1",
                                                "text": "„Je unwichtiger Sie also die Situation nehmen, desto schneller bauen Sie damit die natürliche Abwehrreaktion der Frau gegen übliche Anmachen ab.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ac8dd5b-4ca2-3983-a5bb-6b8a2b11caf0",
                                        "entry_id": "41a44cf3-7f74-3580-bb3f-8399d2c9ec6d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "hartnäckige Belästigung einer Person"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d131215-3c0f-41ac-8ffc-5bd957e6c9e7",
                                                "sense_id": "2ac8dd5b-4ca2-3983-a5bb-6b8a2b11caf0",
                                                "text": "Die ständige Anmache der Mitschüler aufgrund seiner Unsportlichkeit setzt Samuel schwer zu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e3cc3a5-afda-4be3-9e1f-a2d74c4f8e4f",
                                                "sense_id": "2ac8dd5b-4ca2-3983-a5bb-6b8a2b11caf0",
                                                "text": "„Der Schrecken über den unangekündigten Überfall und die plumpe Anmache saß mir in den Knochen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb106b0b-a7c0-49e0-ae18-5302f2fc731c",
                        "source_entry_id": "e73ba547-53c0-3d3d-9d09-ed6eb59738ed",
                        "source_sense_id": "f2697dd9-9b2b-345d-9d87-a56e47081354",
                        "target_lang_word": "schöntun",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "schöntun",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "375c66b4-9aa4-315b-87a1-59be9fd3aaf3",
                                        "entry_id": "9fc4a6fc-1f95-3711-a87a-f7136d4ae04d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(mit einer bestimmten Absicht) nett zu jemandem sein, ihm schmeicheln"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "with-dative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ef43c97-205e-41dc-ba32-ed8b4c8a718d",
                                                "sense_id": "375c66b4-9aa4-315b-87a1-59be9fd3aaf3",
                                                "text": "„Auch ihr Kind lernte er kennen, es war ein grobknochiger Bursche mit stumpfem Gesicht, ungelenk von Gliedern und mürrisch. Berchtold tat ihm schön.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03618486-3c39-4833-ae5e-e9dca616f5f4",
                                                "sense_id": "375c66b4-9aa4-315b-87a1-59be9fd3aaf3",
                                                "text": "„Unterwegs begegnet ihr der Wolf und fängt an schönzutun: ‚Wo bist du denn die ganze Zeit gewesen, Gevatterin? Wir haben alle Höhlen abgesucht und dich nicht gefunden.‘“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18114f32-4638-46cc-bf9d-6ac82abeab97",
                                                "sense_id": "375c66b4-9aa4-315b-87a1-59be9fd3aaf3",
                                                "text": "„»Ihr habt ganz offen mit mir schöngetan«, sagte ich unwirsch. »Ich habe nicht mit Euch schöngetan, ich habe Euch den Hof gemacht«, berichtigte er mich.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "accd795f-3977-4afa-a833-047476f83dcc",
                        "source_entry_id": "e73ba547-53c0-3d3d-9d09-ed6eb59738ed",
                        "source_sense_id": "f2697dd9-9b2b-345d-9d87-a56e47081354",
                        "target_lang_word": "wooing",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wooing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1cc3696b-9701-3206-ba5b-3cd6cf3e5e4b",
                                        "entry_id": "d730dfc5-b7f1-3073-809c-a6eed937b7ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of woo"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a29d7934-35c4-4770-aece-88de2c2c2685",
                                                "sense_id": "1cc3696b-9701-3206-ba5b-3cd6cf3e5e4b",
                                                "text": "A man giving a gift of roses is wooing a woman."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wooing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1fc91f5-7594-3e80-9c5c-bbbafc241604",
                                        "entry_id": "9ec0ed58-c19d-3fe5-be9f-c1ca925eefa2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A courting; the process by which somebody is wooed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d473db3-fae7-40c5-ac9c-b6a1d0bce71c",
                                                "sense_id": "d1fc91f5-7594-3e80-9c5c-bbbafc241604",
                                                "text": "\"Sweet soul! I know his appetite,\" said Mrs. Mallowe. \"Did he, oh did he, begin his wooing?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20d7765e-adbd-48ed-af47-514f90aad95c",
                                                "sense_id": "d1fc91f5-7594-3e80-9c5c-bbbafc241604",
                                                "text": "She felt a little as she had used to feel when she sat by her now wedded husband in the same spot during his wooing, shutting her eyes to his defects of character, and regarding him only in his ideal presentation as lover."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b53c3d37-27b3-4270-a027-69a4fc5593aa",
                                                "sense_id": "d1fc91f5-7594-3e80-9c5c-bbbafc241604",
                                                "text": "She was like a Beardsley Salome, he had said. And indeed she had the narrow eyes and the high cheekbone of that creature, and as nearly the sinuosity as is compatible with human symmetry. His wooing had been brief but incisive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a9601cf-8188-4f83-ab44-9fd17792ffee",
                                                "sense_id": "d1fc91f5-7594-3e80-9c5c-bbbafc241604",
                                                "text": "The difference here is that the protagonists in this collection are, for the most part, at the end of their lives, and so the news of familial drama and divorce and the cocktail parties, barbecues and casual wooings of quotidian life in suburbia is given retrospectively, wistfully, presented in the larger context as memories of lost moments and lost opportunities."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
